## Next Steps for Deployment

To complete the Vercel Analytics setup:

1. **Enable Analytics on Vercel Dashboard**:
   - Go to the Vercel dashboard
   - Select this project
   - Click the "Analytics" tab
   - Click "Enable" from the dialog

2. **Deploy to Vercel**:
   - Run `vercel deploy` or connect the Git repository
   - After deployment, the `/_vercel/insights/*` routes will be available

3. **Verify Tracking**:
   - Visit the deployed site
   - Open browser DevTools → Network tab
   - Look for requests to `/_vercel/insights/view`
   - If visible, tracking is working correctly

4. **View Analytics Data**:
   - Go to your Vercel dashboard
   - Select the project
   - Click the "Analytics" tab
   - After a few days, data will be available for viewing and filtering

## Notes

- The implementation uses `@vercel/analytics/react` which provides automatic route tracking with React Router
- No additional configuration is needed for the Analytics component
- The component is framework-aware and will automatically detect page changes
- Privacy and compliance standards are automatically handled by Vercel Analytics
